# .NET MAUI .gitignore
# Copy this to your project root

## Build output
bin/
obj/

## IDE
.vs/
.vscode/
*.user
*.suo
*.sln.docstates

## Rider
.idea/
*.sln.iml

## macOS
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~.nib
Thumbs.db

## Secrets — NEVER commit
appsettings.json
appsettings.*.json
secrets.json
*.p12
*.pfx
*.key
*.pem

## iOS specific
*.ipa
*.dSYM.zip
*.dSYM

## Android specific
*.apk
*.aab
*.keystore
google-services.json

## iOS provisioning
*.mobileprovision
*.provisionprofile

## NuGet
*.nupkg
**/packages/*
!packages/build/

## Test results
TestResults/
coverage.xml
*.trx

## Claude Code local settings (project-specific, don't share)
.claude/settings.local.json
